    "description": "Solis is a prime residential project by Sobha Realty in Dubai's Motor City. Sobha Solis Dubai Apartments has 4 buildings, 28 to 46 floors. This UAE prime property has 1550 semi-furnished 1-BR apartments, 1.5-BR apartments, 2-BR apartments, and 3-BR apartments. Sobha Solis's price starts from AED 1M. Its master plan, triangular-shaped, places it near the Dubai Autodrome, which has direct access to Umm Suqeim Road and proximity to the Miracle Garden and the proposed Blue Line metro. Residents enjoy unobstructed views of Dubai's skyline due to the absence of nearby high-rises. The project includes a retail boulevard and modern amenities, ensuring a vibrant lifestyle. It is well-connected to major highways and business hubs. With its strategic location, Sobha Solis Dubai Property offers high ROI potential and capital appreciation and appeals to investors and residents alike. The Sobha Solis Payment Plan follows a 60:40 Plan.",
    "descriptionAr": "Solis is a prime residential project by Sobha Realty in Dubai's Motor City. Sobha Solis Dubai Apartments has 4 buildings, 28 to 46 floors. This UAE prime property has 1550 semi-furnished 1-BR apartments, 1.5-BR apartments, 2-BR apartments, and 3-BR apartments. Sobha Solis's price starts from AED 1M. Its master plan, triangular-shaped, places it near the Dubai Autodrome, which has direct access to Umm Suqeim Road and proximity to the Miracle Garden and the proposed Blue Line metro. Residents enjoy unobstructed views of Dubai's skyline due to the absence of nearby high-rises. The project includes a retail boulevard and modern amenities, ensuring a vibrant lifestyle. It is well-connected to major highways and business hubs. With its strategic location, Sobha Solis Dubai Property offers high ROI potential and capital appreciation and appeals to investors and residents alike. The Sobha Solis Payment Plan follows a 60:40 Plan.",
