    "description": "Hillcrest at Arjan, Dubai is a newly launched low-rise residential tower by Binghatti Developers, offering modern apartments designed for comfort, style, and luxury. The development stands at Arjan Dubailand's core area where it connects to Umm Suqeim Street and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road and major destinations including Dubai Hills Mall and Dubai Autodrome and Business Bay. The project features elegantly designed studios, 1 & 2-bedroom apartments, with Binghatti Hillcrest sizes varying according to each layout—perfect for both investors and families. Binghatti Hillcrest price starts from AED 825K for Studio, AED 1.325M for 1-BR & for 2-BR will be announced soon so don't miss the chance to get a luxurious property in one of Dubai's fastest growing communities. Residents will enjoy a luxurious lifestyle with 10+ premium amenities including swimming pools, fitness zones, landscaped gardens, kids' play areas and retail spaces all in a peaceful and family friendly environment.",
