    "description": "Skyflame is a residential project by Binghatti Developers, offering stylish studio, 1 bedroom, and 2 bedroom apartments in Dubai. It is located in Majan, Dubai. Designed with Binghatti's signature modern architecture, Binghatti Skyflame's twin towers rise above the clouds, which elevated the urban lifestyle in Dubai. Luxury apartment sizes are yet to be announced. Binghatti Skyflame apartments price starts from AED 699K. The residential property offers world-class amenities including a swimming pool, gym, kid's area, landscaped leisure areas, dedicated parking and 24/7 security. The payment system which requires a 70:30 split and increasing rental market interest makes Binghatti Skyflame apartments the perfect combination of current luxury living and future property value growth.",
    "descriptionAr": "Skyflame is a residential project by Binghatti Developers, offering stylish studio, 1 bedroom, and 2 bedroom apartments in Dubai. It is located in Majan, Dubai. Designed with Binghatti's signature modern architecture, Binghatti Skyflame's twin towers rise above the clouds, which elevated the urban lifestyle in Dubai. Luxury apartment sizes are yet to be announced. Binghatti Skyflame apartments price starts from AED 699K. The residential property offers world-class amenities including a swimming pool, gym, kid's area, landscaped leisure areas, dedicated parking and 24/7 security. The payment system which requires a 70:30 split and increasing rental market interest makes Binghatti Skyflame apartments the perfect combination of current luxury living and future property value growth.",
