    "description": "is a project by the well-known developer Damac Properties. Bellavista Damac Hills Dubai has studio apartments, 1 BR, and 2 BR apartments with elegant designs in the Damac Hills area of Dubai. Three residential towers with great views of the whole Damac Hills development and access to world-class amenities. The towers are surrounded by beautiful green fairways. The whole development has a high-end feel, with elegantly designed lobbies and apartments that look out over nature and the golf course in a beautiful way. A master-planned community with all the services and a wide range of shopping, dining, and entertainment options right outside your door. It has a lot of parks and playgrounds and unobstructed views of sparkling greenery and fairways. It also has a lot of places to shop, a swimming pool, and plenty of places to relax.",
