    "description": "Properties is building a new area called Golf Gate at Damac Hills, which has luxury apartments with one or two bedrooms and views of the golf course. This exclusive collection of golf-themed homes comes with exclusive amenities that make life comfortable and easy for the people who live there. In Dubai's well-known Damac Hills, you'll find a luxury-themed golfing community that will welcome you with its exclusive facilities. The major roads, like Emirates Road and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road, make it easy to get to and from the development. Get easy and smooth access to the most famous landmarks and your favorite place to go, both of which are only a few minutes away. The Trump International Golf Club Dubai, which has a training academy and pro shops, is one of the community's main draws. People who live there can check out the Trump-branded and managed clubhouses, which have restaurants, pools, and gyms.",
